      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHADOW ASSASSIN (1) was game in defeat when finished in the minors last start over the 515m at this track, running a sharp 29.31 in a Grade 5. Has the ability and looks hard to top. I'M ALRIGHT (2) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fourth (29.96) at this track last time. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Goes well out of this box with a win and six minor placings. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. GYPSY IBROX (4) was a winner two back then strongly fancied last time but could only manage a third (29.59) at this track. Expected to feature again. DOLLAR KEEPING (3) scored last time and appeals as a top-three prospect.",
